## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design tenant-scoped enrichment with strong isolation and rollout safety.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant config versioning
- Idempotent enrichment and exactly-once semantics
- Canary rollouts and rollback safety
- Late-data handling and reprocessing

